###===================================================
###PRUEBAS 8.2 autenticacion JWT
###===================================================

### LOGIN ADMIN
# @name loginAdmin
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/login/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "admin_taller",
    "password": "admin123"
}

###

@accessToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.access}}
@refreshToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.refresh}}

### ADMIN VE MECANICOS
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/mecanicos/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### SIN TOKEN DEBE DAR 401
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/mecanicos/

### REFRESH TOKEN
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/refresh/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "refresh": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### VERIFY TOKEN
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/verify/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "token": "{{accessToken}}"
}


