### ADMIN VE AUDIT LOGS
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/audit-logs/
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.access}}

### ADMIN FILTRA AUDIT LOGS POR ACCION CREAR CLIENTE
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/audit-logs/?accion=crear_cliente
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.access}}

### ADMIN FILTRA AUDIT LOGS POR ACCION COMPLETAR ORDEN
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/audit-logs/?accion=completar_orden
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.access}}

### MECANICO NO VE AUDIT LOGS DEBE DAR 403
